    "answer": {
      "short": "$(2^x+3^x)(4^x+5^x)$.\n\nFactor the terms in pairs.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}8^x+10^x+12^x+15^x&=2^x4^x+2^x5^x+3^x4^x+3^x5^x\\\\8^x+10^x+12^x+15^x&=2^x(4^x+5^x)+3^x(4^x+5^x)\\\\8^x+10^x+12^x+15^x&=(2^x+3^x)(4^x+5^x).\\end{align*}$$\nThus one choice is $a=2$, $b=3$, $c=4$, $d=5$.",
